WEBVTT

00:13:59.362 --> 00:14:02.829
spend an average of 23 hours
in between each communication.

00:14:03.265 --> 00:14:07.547
And that's what we would normally do
in the usual process of courtship.

00:14:07.571 --> 00:14:08.757
And finally --

00:14:09.592 --> 00:14:11.147
there were the photos.

00:14:11.171 --> 00:14:14.196
All of the women who were popular
showed some skin.

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.422
They all looked really great,

00:14:16.446 --> 00:14:19.324
which turned out to be in sharp contrast

00:14:19.348 --> 00:14:20.848
to what I had uploaded.

00:14:20.872 --> 00:14:22.610
(Laughter)

00:14:22.634 --> 00:14:24.340
Once I had all of this information,

00:14:24.364 --> 00:14:26.477
I was able to create a super profile,

00:14:26.501 --> 00:14:28.502
so it was still me,

00:14:28.526 --> 00:14:31.494
but it was me optimized now
for this ecosystem.